hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"140","Mā min ‘abdin yudhnibu dhanban fa-yuḥsinu al-ṭahūra, thaqma yaqūmu fa-yuṣallī rak‘atayn, thumma yastaghfiru Allāha illā ghafara Allāhu lahu.. No servant commits a sin, then performs ablution well, stands and prays two rak‘ahs, and then seeks forgiveness from Allah, but Allah will forgive him."
"141","Al-Isti'aadhah billaah minhu. Seeking refuge in Allah from it"
